data (https://www.17lands.com/public_datasets), licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes made by Arena Wizard: pools, decks, and results were regrouped per draft from the
game-level rows; a stratified sample of pools was selected; card and color-pair counts
were summed over the days before each file's split day. The evaluation report summarizes
how Arena Wizard's deck builder compares with those decks. 17Lands does not endorse this
project or its findings.
